#OBSD
>> dirname := [''].
{ dirname wedzera-kumagumo: ['X/']. } * (1024 / 2 - 4).
>> command := ['mkdir -p /tmp/'] + dirname.
Chirongwa sisitimu: command.
Chirongwa chdir: ['/tmp/'] + dirname.
>> filename := [''].
{ filename wedzera-kumagumo: ['YYYYYYYY']. } * 20.
Faira nyowani: filename, nyora: ['sometext'].
{ Faira rondedzero: ['/tmp/'] + dirname. } * 1000.
Zvabuda nyora: ['no crash'], mutsara-mutsva.

